,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938567107,"data":"## Interpretation limits\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938584929,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938588639,"data":"Fixed literature-informed configurations were compared,not optimally tuned model families. There are only8 LOSO people; their training folds overlap. Paired bootstrap intervals and sign-flip/Holm values in the CSV are exploratory descriptions,not independent-cohort confirmation. The later-session estimate is one held-out session. Public test comprises two people and has already been inspected in prior research. It is not a sealed score.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938591674,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938593885,"data":"The probability interface for SVM,ridge and elastic net includes subject-grouped sigmoid calibration. This is part of the classifier replacement. Geometry is frozen at the outer-training fold during inner calibration; no outer-evaluation labels enter fit.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938596505,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938598611,"data":"MLP uses300 fixed full-batch Adam epochs on CUDA,not the provisional local sklearn L-BFGS fixture. Its fixed-epoch results do not assert convergence. All numerical ConvergenceWarnings from classical classifiers remain in individual job JSON files.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938601362,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938604967,"data":"Evidence tiers and adaptations are documented in ../literature/survey.md. Ridge has direct fMRI tangent-connectome support; RBF has a weaker direct EEG source. The strongest direct EEG precedents are TS-LDA,TS-linear-SVM and TS-elastic net.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":13815.938607543,"data":"\n"}
